{"unit_id":"zwbao__dsh-plugin-mirobody#card-zh","repo":"zwbao/dsh-plugin-mirobody","commit":"b2356f094495670783c65d3aa471fb3bdf857516","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mirobody 是面向 DSH Web 的 Mirobody 健康数据插件：它注册工具、斜杠命令、提示规则、受连接检查保护的 HTTP 路由，以及会话中的 Mirobody 面板。离线引擎可把指标名解析为 LOINC、按数值和单位解析读数，并转换或规范化 UCUM 单位；记录工具可只读查询健康指标、用药计划与记录、基因型和药物基因组学信息。还提供状态查看、快捷解析、五类技能和健康安全提示。适合需要在 DSH 中整理健康测量并查看个人 Mirobody 记录的用户；术语功能走本机 Python 引擎，读取记录前需配置 Mirobody MCP 地址及相应授权。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:16-29","src/tools.ts:25-289","src/client/panel.ts:25-68"]}
{"unit_id":"zwbao__dsh-plugin-mirobody#card-en","repo":"zwbao/dsh-plugin-mirobody","commit":"b2356f094495670783c65d3aa471fb3bdf857516","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-mirobody adds health tools and a panel to DSH web. Its local engine resolves LOINC names and standardizes UCUM units. Read-only tools query health, medication, genotype, and pharmacogenomics records from a configured Mirobody server. Record access requires account authorization.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:16-29","src/tools.ts:25-289","src/client/panel.ts:25-68"]}
