{"unit_id":"zwbao__dsh-plugin-mirobody#feature-1","repo":"zwbao/dsh-plugin-mirobody","commit":"b2356f094495670783c65d3aa471fb3bdf857516","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mirobody 的功能「指标与读数解析」：把指标名称或名称、数值和单位交给离线引擎解析为 LOINC；批量输入返回匹配结果，无法确认时保持未解析。 由 DSH 工具调用，输入参数并返回结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:25-100"]}
{"unit_id":"zwbao__dsh-plugin-mirobody#feature-2","repo":"zwbao/dsh-plugin-mirobody","commit":"b2356f094495670783c65d3aa471fb3bdf857516","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mirobody 的功能「单位规范与转换」：将自由格式单位规范为 UCUM，或在给定源单位、目标单位及数值后执行转换；不兼容时返回空转换结果。 由 DSH 工具调用，输入参数并返回结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:100-150"]}
{"unit_id":"zwbao__dsh-plugin-mirobody#feature-3","repo":"zwbao/dsh-plugin-mirobody","commit":"b2356f094495670783c65d3aa471fb3bdf857516","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mirobody 的功能「健康及用药记录」：通过配置的 MCP 服务器只读查询健康指标、时间序列视图，以及用药计划、剂量日志和疗程历史。 由 DSH 工具调用，输入参数并返回结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:150-220"]}
{"unit_id":"zwbao__dsh-plugin-mirobody#feature-4","repo":"zwbao/dsh-plugin-mirobody","commit":"b2356f094495670783c65d3aa471fb3bdf857516","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-mirobody 的功能「基因和药物基因组学」：按 rsID、基因或基因组区段读取已上传的基因型，也可查找 CPIC A/B 药物基因对及覆盖位点。 由 DSH 工具调用，输入参数并返回结构化结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:220-289"]}
